    "title": "Educational & Accuracy Disclaimer",
    "text": "This calculator provides financial estimates based on the Inland Revenue Ordinance (Cap. 112) and official schedules issued by the Inland Revenue Department (IRD) of Hong Kong. Actual tax liabilities and provisional tax assessments are determined by the IRD based on your submitted BIR60 tax return. For complex expatriate remuneration packages or cross-border assignments, consult a qualified Hong Kong tax advisor."
